-- Seed data: master/reference catalogs, translated German -> English.
-- Source: production export (textil_marken, textil_produkte, textil_varianten, stempel_modelle).
-- Loaded automatically by `supabase db reset`. Insert order respects FKs.
--
-- Translated: column names; enum values (stamp type/color/size, textile finishing_options).
-- Kept as-is: UUIDs, proper/brand names, textile colour names & sizes (already English),
--   and free-text `name`/`note` (production catalog names — may still contain German words).
-- NOTE: a few apparent test rows from production are included (e.g. product name '111').
-- NOTE: `stock` is seeded as 0 everywhere — stock is transactional data, not
--   master data (real levels only exist in the live DB). Dev stock levels are
--   set in seed.dev.sql. `min_stock` (reorder threshold) is kept as exported.


